    "notes": "Detection signal for T1018: focus on net.exe or nltest.exe with discovery arguments (view /domain, /dclist, group 'Domain Computers') where process.parent.executable originates outside system32/program files — specifically paths under C:\\ProgramData\\ or user-writable directories. A burst of 3+ discovery commands from the same parent PID within a short window (< 10 seconds) is a high-confidence indicator of automated C2 enumeration. False positives arise from SCCM/MECM (CcmExec.exe), Lansweeper, and interactive admin sessions (cmd.exe / powershell.exe parents). Tune by excluding parent executables matching known management tools signed by Microsoft or known vendors."
